# AETHER UNIVERSE - a complete deterministic play-through of all nine secrets.
#
# Run it:  aether-universe --script tests/playthrough.txt --seat <name>
# The nine answers below are the kernel's own computed numbers; the game compares them with what it
# computed, never with a stored string. With data/enwik8 absent, chapter 8 counts the bundled page
# (story/white-page.txt: 412 bytes, 78 white, 1893 per 10,000) and says so in its rows.

# ---- chapter 1: Hollow Strata, count is not range
look
probe 13
probe 14
trits 14
solve 26:13
look
solve 27:13

# ---- chapter 2: Flow Channel, a PID needs 41 trits
go flow
look
trits 18446744073709551615
probe 0xffffffffffffffff
solve 41

# ---- chapter 3: Prime Cylinders, the spokes
go cylinders
probe 5
probe 7
solve -1:189

# ---- chapter 4: Hotel of Infinite Rooms, addresses never move
go hotel
probe 2
probe 1000003 1000033
solve 5

# ---- chapter 5: Rupture Zone, the closure survives 81 levels
go rupture
look
probe 81
solve 0

# ---- chapter 6: Crystalline Reach, the prism closes on 40 bits
go crystal
probe hello
solve 40

# ---- chapter 7: 27-Cube Chamber, Law 10
go cube
look
probe 3
probe 13
solve 18:3

# ---- chapter 8: White Field, the page you hold
go white
look
probe the quick brown fox
probe field
solve page:1893

# ---- chapter 9: Blue Star, Mythos
go star
probe star
solve 3dd92a42:32,32,33

# ---- the world kept running while you read it: look back through sealed snapshots, read-only
wait 27
rewind 10
map
rewind live
timeline
codex 9
map

# ---- bridge, verify, and seal
save finish
verify
quit
